From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 03:14:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/28] clocksource/drivers: Add Celestial CNC1800L timer
 driver

Add a driver for the AHB clock event timer (94.5MHz) and the APB clock
source and sched_clock timer (47.25MHz) of the CNC1800L.

Register addresses and IRQ numbers come from the vendor 2.6.32 GPL BSP.
The APB timer is only read with 16 bit accesses, as the vendor code
does, so the DesignWare APB timer driver (32 bit accesses) is not used.

Signed-off-by: Tsuji Riya <tsuji.riya@gmail.com>
